21;). </div></td><td style="width: 2pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 2pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 9pt; padding-top: 7.22pt; padding-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 1pt; text-align: left;">4</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 290pt; padding-top: 7.24pt; padding-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Approval of the amendment and restatement of the Company&#8217;s 2019 Incentive Award Plan. </div></td><td style="width: 2pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 2pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 9pt; padding-top: 7.22pt; padding-bottom: 7.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 1pt; text-align: left;">5</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 290pt; padding-top: 7