tica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Your vote is important.<span style="color: #000000; font-weight: normal;"> Voting your shares will ensure the presence of a quorum at the Annual Meeting and will save us the expense of further solicitation. </span><span style="color: #000000;">Please promptly vote your shares by completing, signing, dating and returning your proxy card or by Internet or telephone voting as described on your proxy card.</span><span style="color: #000000; font-weight: normal;"> </span></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">By Order of the Board of Directors </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">/s/ Dario Scimeca </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Dario Scimeca <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;">General Counsel and Secretary </span></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Durham, North Carolina <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">April&#160;8, 2026 </div><div><div class="BRDSX_rule-partial" style="height: 0pt; width: 30pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #3283C5; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-right: auto; margin-left: 0pt; margin-top: 13.75pt;"> </div></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Important Notice Regarding the Availability of Proxy Materials for the Stockholder Meeting: This Proxy Statement and our Annual Report are available free of charge at www.proxyvote.com.</div></div></div></div><div>
