</div><div class="BRDSX_page" style="text-align: left; margin: auto; line-height: initial; width: 522pt;"><a id="ny20064330x2_def14a_104-qna_pg5"><!--Anchor--></a><p style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold"><a href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></p><div class="BRDSX_page-content"><div class="BRDSX_block-main" style="width: 522pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><a id="tGI17"></a><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-spacing: 0; margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><tr><td style="width: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"><!--Anchor-->Q:<br/></div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">How many votes are required to approve each proposal? </div></td></tr></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-spacing: 0; margin-top: 9pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><tr><td style="width: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">A:<br/></div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; font-size: 9pt;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: normal;">The table below summarizes the proposals that will be voted on, the vote required to approve each item and how votes are counted: </span></div></td></tr></table><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"> </div><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_txttab" style="border-spacing: 0; border-bottom: 1pt solid #3283C5; width: 522pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr