e="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">Current Position at Precision </div></td><td style="width: 3pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 162pt; padding-top: 1.9pt; padding-bottom: 2.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 1.5pt; text-align: left;">Michael Amoroso</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 30pt; padding-top: 1.9pt; padding-bottom: 2.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">48</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 108pt; padding-top: 1.9pt; padding-bottom: 2.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">2021</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="widt