s-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;"><span style="padding-left: 16.45pt;">&#8212;</span></div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 76pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;"><span style="padding-left: 27.57pt;">&#8212;</span></div></td><td style="width: 5pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 5pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 336pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; text-align: left;">Each other person who received or is to receive 5 percent of such options, warrants or rights</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 76pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;"><span style="padding-left: 16.45pt;">&#8212;</span></div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 76pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;"><span style="padding-left: 27.57pt;">&#8212;</span></div></td><td style="width: 5pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 336pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; text-align: left;">All Non-Executive Officer Employees as a Group (63 persons)</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 76pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">26,810</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 76pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;"><span style="padding-left: 6.67pt;">822,242</span></div></td><td style="width: 5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspac