<td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 81pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">Nominating and<br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">Corporate <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">Governance<br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">Committee</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; background-color: #EDEDED; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 81pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #EDEDED; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">Science and<br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">Technology <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">Committee </div></td><td style="width: 3pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 144pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 1.5pt; text-align: left;">Melinda Brown</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 81pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">Chair</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; background-color: #EDEDED; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 81pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #EDEDED; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">&#8203;X</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; background-color: #EDEDED; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 81pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRD