kel is to provide the Company with such consulting, advisory and related services as may reasonably be requested through June 30, 2026 unless the consulting agreement is extended by mutual agreement or earlier terminated. The consulting agreement has been filed as an exhibit to our Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2025. </div></td></tr></table><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">The table below shows the aggregate numbers of option awards and RSUs held as of December&#160;31, 2025 by each non-employee director who was serving as of December&#160;31, 2025. </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"> </div><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_fintab" style="border-spacing: 0; border-bottom: 1pt solid #3283C5; width: 522pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 216pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="4" style="height: 6pt; width: 185.66pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 60.32pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_header"><td style="width: 5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 216pt; padding-b