: 5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></ix:continuation><ix:continuation continuedAt="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_4" id="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_3"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="ecd:NamedExecutiveOfficersFnTextBlock" id="ixv-12322"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-spacing: 0; margin-top: 9pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><tr><td style="width: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">(1)<br/></div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; text-align: left;">Summary Compensation Table amounts reported include the fair value of stock grants calculated in accordance with ASC 718, rather than the cash amounts paid to or realized by the named individual. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c2" name="ecd:PeoName" id="ixv-14463"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c1" name="ecd:PeoName" id="ixv-14464"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" name="ecd:PeoName" id="ixv-14465">Mr.&#160;Amoroso</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric> served as our principal executive officer (&#8220;PEO&#8221;) for the full year in 2023, 2024 and 2025. The Non-PEO Named Executive Officers (the &#8220;Non-PEO NEOs&#8221;) include the following individuals: for fiscal year 2025, Mr.&#160;Kelly and Mr.&#160;Scimeca, for fiscal year 2024, Mr.&#160;Kelly and Dr.&#160;Smith, and for fiscal year 2023, Mr. Kelly and Dr. List. </div></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation><ix:continuation continuedAt="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_5" id="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_4"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_AdjToNonPeoNeoCompFnTextBlock-c0_alt_0_cont_1" escape="true" name="ecd:AdjToNonPeoNeoCompFnTextBlock" id="ixv-12331"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="ecd:AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock" id="ixv-12332"><table border="0