</div><div class="BRDSX_page" style="text-align: left; margin: auto; line-height: initial; width: 522pt;"><a id="ny20064330x2_def14a_111-compensation_pg10"><!--Anchor--></a><p style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold"><a href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></p><div class="BRDSX_page-content"><div class="BRDSX_block-main" style="width: 522pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_h1" style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 21pt; margin-top: 14pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a id="tECPI"><!--Anchor--></a>Equity Compensation Plan Information <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_h1" style="color: #3283C5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 21pt; margin-top: -18pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 30pt;"></div><div class="BRDSX_ftnote" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">The following table provides information on our equity compensation plans as of December&#160;31, 2025. </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 8.5pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"> </div><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_fintab" style="border-spacing: 0; border-bottom: 1pt solid #3283C5; width: 522pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 264pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.08pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.08pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 50.79pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.07pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.07pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 64.22pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.07pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 12.07pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 55.54pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 10pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_header"><td style="width: 5pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 264pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; text-align: left;">Plan Category</div></td><td style="width: 12.08pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 12.08pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 50.79pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; white-space: nowrap; text-align: right;">Number of<br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; white-space: nowrap; text-align: right;">Securities<br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; white-space: nowrap; text-align: right;">to be Issued<br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara