idth: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">(1)<br/></div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; text-align: left;">Based solely on information reported on a Schedule 13G filed on February&#160;10, 2026, Octagon Capital Advisors LP, Octagon Investments Master Fund LP, and Ting Jia as the principal beneficial owner have shared voting power and shared dispositive power over 2,328,485 shares of our common stock. The 2,328,485 shares of common stock consist of (a) 1,917,995 shares of common stock plus (b) 410,490 shares of common stock issuable upon exercise of warrants. The business address of each of Octagon Capital Advisors LP, Octagon Investments Master Fund LP, and Ting Jia is 654&#160;Madison Avenue, 21st Floor, New York, NY 10065. </div></td></tr></table></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 522pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_gftxt" style="border-spacing: 0; margin-top: 4pt; width: 522pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 237pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 24pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 237pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 237pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margi